---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Shipping and returns">
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Help</p>
      <h1>Shipping and returns</h1>
      <p class="note small">Fjordbloom is a demo brand. These policies are realistic examples for AVA training, not real terms.</p>

      <h2>Shipping</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Destination</th><th>Delivery time</th><th>Cost</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Denmark</td><td>1 to 2 working days</td><td>Free from €50, otherwise €4.90</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Rest of the EU</td><td>2 to 5 working days</td><td>Free from €50, otherwise €4.90</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Norway, Switzerland, UK</td><td>3 to 7 working days</td><td>€9.90; duties may apply</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>Orders placed before 14:00 CET on a working day leave our Copenhagen warehouse the same day. You get a tracking link by email.</p>

      <h2>Returns</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Unopened products: return within 30 days for a full refund.</li>
        <li>Opened products that did not suit your skin: return within 14 days and we refund the product price.</li>
        <li>Sale items, including the Arctic Barrier Day Cream offer, follow the same rules.</li>
        <li>Refunds go back to the original payment method within 5 working days of the return arriving.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Damaged or missing items</h2>
      <p>Send a photo within 7 days of delivery and we will send a replacement at no cost.</p>

      <h2>Sold-out products</h2>
      <p>The Rose Quartz Gua Sha and the Midnight Plum lip balm shade are sold out. Restocks usually take a few weeks.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
